    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		vena, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of veins</i>, <i>veiny</i>, <i>venous.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">renes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 7, 10, § 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					25, 13, 100, § 157</span></i>
			: 
